{"id":"9dc7a4f521be5fee","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-eta-cohomology.md","title":"Étale Cohomology","display":"df-eta-cohomology — Étale Cohomology","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-eta-cohomology","aliases":["58-df-eta-cohomology"],"display":"df-eta-cohomology — Étale Cohomology","depends_on":["[[58-df-site-sheaf-cohomology.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-eta-cohomology"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-eta-cohomology</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-eta-cohomology — Étale Cohomology"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6eedc7cef16ac70e\" href=\"?note=6eedc7cef16ac70e\" title=\"58-df-site-sheaf-cohomology.md\">58-df-site-sheaf-cohomology.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\mathrm{\\acute et}},\\mathcal F,H\\in V\">\\(X_{\\mathrm{\\acute et}},\\mathcal F,H\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\omega\">\\(i\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>第三个参数仍是给定站点代码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\mathrm{\\acute et}}=\\langle\\mathcal C,J\\rangle\">\\(X_{\\mathrm{\\acute et}}=\\langle\\mathcal C,J\\rangle\\)</span>，不是一个尚待构造 étale 站点的概形。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ab}\\in V\">\\(\\mathsf{Ab}\\in V\\)</span> 是本定义固定的阿贝尔值范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathsf{Ab})\">\\(\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathsf{Ab})\\)</span>；不任意改变系数值范畴。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SiteSheafCohomology}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{SiteSheafCohomology}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> 使用新增的 58 内部站点定义；拓扑空间上的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SheafCohomology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SheafCohomology}_S\\)</span> 仍保持原八元接口。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EtaleCohomology}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{EtaleCohomology}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> 是下述定义的谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}eta\\text{-}cohomology}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EtaleCohomology}_S(H,i,X_{\\mathrm{\\acute et}},\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal D,\\Gamma\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{SiteSheafCohomology}_S(H,i,X_{\\mathrm{\\acute et}},\\mathcal F,\\mathcal D,\\mathsf{Ab},\\Gamma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}eta\\text{-}cohomology}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EtaleCohomology}_S(H,i,X_{\\mathrm{\\acute et}},\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal D,\\Gamma\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{SiteSheafCohomology}_S(H,i,X_{\\mathrm{\\acute et}},\\mathcal F,\\mathcal D,\\mathsf{Ab},\\Gamma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>保留给定站点上的相对上同调对象；本次不另行添加概形到 étale 站点的构造，也不把站点替换成 Zariski 拓扑空间。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal D\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 的存在量化受完整范畴构造、求值及左正合公式约束，并非任意选择两个名字作为占位符。</li>\n<li>文件名中的 eta 历史拼写未改动。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-site-sheaf-cohomology.md","status":"resolved","id":"6eedc7cef16ac70e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-site-sheaf-cohomology.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X_{\\mathrm{\\acute et}},\\mathcal F,H\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"X_{\\mathrm{\\acute et}}=\\langle\\mathcal C,J\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ab}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathsf{Ab})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SiteSheafCohomology}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SheafCohomology}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EtaleCohomology}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}eta\\text{-}cohomology}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EtaleCohomology}_S(H,i,X_{\\mathrm{\\acute et}},\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal D,\\Gamma\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{SiteSheafCohomology}_S(H,i,X_{\\mathrm{\\acute et}},\\mathcal F,\\mathcal D,\\mathsf{Ab},\\Gamma).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false}],"bytes":1525,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-495","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-eta-cohomology.md|58-df-eta-cohomology]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["6eedc7cef16ac70e"]}